1
00:01:39,866 --> 00:01:40,799
Sophie?

2
00:01:41,668 --> 00:01:43,295
I've closed the shop.

3
00:01:43,403 --> 00:01:45,895
Why aren't you coming to the party with us?

4
00:01:46,006 --> 00:01:47,269
I'm going to finish this one up instead.

5
00:01:47,374 --> 00:01:49,035
Go have fun.

6
00:01:49,276 --> 00:01:51,608
Alright, see you tomorrow.

7
00:01:52,079 --> 00:01:52,671
Okay, ladies!

8
00:01:52,813 --> 00:01:53,507
Ahh, just a sec!

9
00:01:53,614 --> 00:01:54,342
How does this look on me?

10
00:01:54,448 --> 00:01:56,542
Look, Howl's castle!

11
00:01:56,650 --> 00:01:58,118
What, where?

12
00:01:58,218 --> 00:02:00,209
Look how close it is!

13
00:02:00,754 --> 00:02:02,244
やあねえ

14
00:02:02,356 --> 00:02:04,347
Do you think he's in town?

15
00:02:12,666 --> 00:02:13,462
He's gone...

16
00:02:13,567 --> 00:02:14,830
He's just hiding in the clouds

17
00:02:14,935 --> 00:02:16,232
what with all those army planes flying about.

18
00:02:16,370 --> 00:02:18,964
Did you hear about Martha from the south end?

19
00:02:19,072 --> 00:02:21,507
They say Howl gobbled up her heart!

20
00:02:21,608 --> 00:02:22,439
Don't freak me out...

21
00:02:22,542 --> 00:02:25,068
Don't worry, he'll never come after you.

22
00:02:26,980 --> 00:02:28,175
Hurry it up!

23
00:04:34,441 --> 00:04:37,206
Hey little lady, looking for something?

24
00:04:37,577 --> 00:04:39,375
Oh, no, I'm just fine.

25
00:04:39,913 --> 00:04:41,904
Then how about a quick drink with us?

26
00:04:42,115 --> 00:04:43,276
?

27
00:04:43,683 --> 00:04:44,980
I'm sorry I can't... I have somewhere to be.

28
00:04:45,085 --> 00:04:47,782
Hey she's a cute one.

29
00:04:47,888 --> 00:04:50,152
How old are you? You live around here?

30
00:04:50,791 --> 00:04:52,020
Please let me pass!

31
00:04:52,492 --> 00:04:55,484
Look man you've scared her off with that beard of yours.

32
00:04:55,562 --> 00:04:57,798
She's even cute when she's angry.

33
00:04:58,031 --> 00:04:59,521
Ah, here you are!

34
00:05:00,667 --> 00:05:01,896
Finally found you.

35
00:05:02,435 --> 00:05:03,266
Who the hell are you?

36
00:05:03,370 --> 00:05:04,860
She's with me.

37
00:05:04,971 --> 00:05:08,134
Why don't you guys for a little stroll?

38
00:05:15,348 --> 00:05:19,114
Forgive them, they're not actually bad guys.

39
00:05:19,219 --> 00:05:20,380
Where are you headed?

40
00:05:20,487 --> 00:05:22,478
Why don't I see you there safely.

41
00:05:22,756 --> 00:05:25,088
I'm just going to Chezarya...

42
00:05:25,525 --> 00:05:27,755
Act normal. I'm being followed.

43
00:05:27,861 --> 00:05:29,090
Walk.

44
00:05:50,050 --> 00:05:51,518
Sorry, looks like I've gotten you involved.

45
00:05:56,389 --> 00:05:57,185
This way!

46
00:06:05,065 --> 00:06:05,759
And now we fly!

47
00:06:11,805 --> 00:06:14,274
Just stretch out your legs and walk like normal.

48
00:06:19,279 --> 00:06:22,476
That's right, don't be afraid.

49
00:06:37,664 --> 00:06:38,961
You're good at this!

50
00:06:53,813 --> 00:06:55,713
I'll draw them off.

51
00:06:55,815 --> 00:06:57,613
Wait here for a bit before you head down.

52
00:06:58,184 --> 00:06:59,174
Okay.

53
00:07:00,020 --> 00:07:01,351
That's my girl.

54
00:07:13,433 --> 00:07:14,298
Here you go.

55
00:07:14,401 --> 00:07:16,802
Is there no chocolate with your name on it?

56
00:07:16,903 --> 00:07:19,099
Hey, gimme one of those too!

57
00:07:19,272 --> 00:07:20,262
My sister?

58
00:07:21,708 --> 00:07:23,699
Lettie, hurry back! We're waiting!

59
00:07:27,547 --> 00:07:28,605
Sophie!

60
00:07:29,382 --> 00:07:29,974
Lettie.

61
00:07:30,083 --> 00:07:30,845
What's wrong?

62
00:07:30,951 --> 00:07:32,112
They said you just appeared from the sky!

63
00:07:32,218 --> 00:07:33,652
When did you become an angel?

64
00:07:34,254 --> 00:07:36,814
I feel like I'm in a dream.

65
00:07:36,923 --> 00:07:39,119
Here Lettie, use the office.

66
00:07:39,259 --> 00:07:42,991
Ah, thanks, but I need to get back right away.

67
00:07:43,930 --> 00:07:47,423
He must have been a wizard!

68
00:07:47,701 --> 00:07:49,499
He was the nicest person I've ever met.

69
00:07:50,370 --> 00:07:52,498
He saved me, actually.

70
00:07:52,605 --> 00:07:53,265
Wait, are you sure

71
00:07:53,373 --> 00:07:55,364
he didn't steal your heart like the others?

72
00:07:56,076 --> 00:07:58,044
Just be glad that wasn't Howl

73
00:07:58,144 --> 00:08:00,078
or you'd be eaten up by now!

74
00:08:00,714 --> 00:08:02,011
Don't worry.

75
00:08:02,315 --> 00:08:04,079
Howl only goes after the pretty ones.

76
00:08:04,451 --> 00:08:05,919
Oh come on...

77
00:08:06,019 --> 00:08:09,250
Listen, the world is a dark place these days!

78
00:08:09,356 --> 00:08:12,917
They're even saying the Witch of the Wastes is wandering about.

79
00:08:13,793 --> 00:08:15,261
Are you listening?

80
00:08:16,763 --> 00:08:18,094
Geez...

81
00:08:20,700 --> 00:08:22,828
Lettie, Madeleine just finished up.

82
00:08:23,503 --> 00:08:25,096
I'll be out in a sec!

83
00:08:25,205 --> 00:08:26,502
Sure.

84
00:08:28,375 --> 00:08:29,900
I'll get going.

85
00:08:30,010 --> 00:08:32,240
I feel much better now that I've seen you.

86
00:08:34,314 --> 00:08:35,281
Hey, Lettie!

87
00:08:35,382 --> 00:08:36,577
Good to see you!

88
00:08:36,950 --> 00:08:38,076
Okay, listen.

89
00:08:38,284 --> 00:08:40,548
Are you really going to stay cooped up in that hat shop
for the rest of your life?

90
00:08:41,988 --> 00:08:44,320
It's all we have left of Father

91
00:08:44,491 --> 00:08:45,583
and I am the eldest, so...

92
00:08:45,692 --> 00:08:46,716
No!

93
00:08:46,826 --> 00:08:50,057
I'm asking if you really want to be a milliner!

94
00:08:50,263 --> 00:08:51,287
Well...

95
00:08:51,398 --> 00:08:52,661
Lettie, see you later!

96
00:08:52,766 --> 00:08:54,131
Come 'round to the shop next time!

97
00:08:55,268 --> 00:08:56,326
I'm going.

98
00:08:56,436 --> 00:08:57,403
Sophie

99
00:08:57,537 --> 00:08:59,437
you have to decide your own path for yourself!

100
00:08:59,539 --> 00:09:00,267
I know.

101
00:10:08,341 --> 00:10:10,366
I'm sorry, we're closed.

102
00:10:10,477 --> 00:10:11,103
Forgive me,

103
00:10:11,211 --> 00:10:13,179
I thought I had locked the door.

104
00:10:15,448 --> 00:10:20,181
Cheap hats in a cheap little shop.

105
00:10:21,287 --> 00:10:24,313
You're nothing much to look at either.

106
00:10:25,758 --> 00:10:28,784
We are but a humble hatter.

107
00:10:34,601 --> 00:10:36,535
Please be on your way.

108
00:10:37,604 --> 00:10:39,834
You're going to tell the Witch of the Wastes what to do?

109
00:10:39,939 --> 00:10:41,031
You're brave.

110
00:10:41,541 --> 00:10:43,168
The Witch of the Wastes?

111
00:10:50,850 --> 00:10:54,115
I've cursed you, but don't bother trying to tell anyone about it.

112
00:10:54,220 --> 00:10:55,915
Say hi to Howl for me.

113
00:11:43,036 --> 00:11:47,906
Is that really me? I need to calm down...

114
00:12:04,023 --> 00:12:05,616
Gotta calm down...

115
00:12:05,792 --> 00:12:09,251
Panicking won't anything Sophie...

116
00:12:10,396 --> 00:12:13,388
This is nothing, it's nothing...

117
00:12:14,534 --> 00:12:18,767
Calm down, calm down...

118
00:12:30,416 --> 00:12:31,611
I'm home!

119
00:12:31,851 --> 00:12:33,148
Madam, welcome back!

120
00:12:33,253 --> 00:12:34,778
What do you think?

121
00:12:34,921 --> 00:12:36,787
It's all the rage in Kingsbury.

122
00:12:38,191 --> 00:12:39,124
It looks amazing.

123
00:12:39,259 --> 00:12:41,387
Wait 'til they all get a look at me.

124
00:12:41,561 --> 00:12:42,494
Sophie!

125
00:12:42,662 --> 00:12:44,027
Sophie! Oh?

126
00:12:44,130 --> 00:12:45,495
Madam

127
00:12:45,598 --> 00:12:47,293
Sophie hasn't come down yet this morning.

128
00:12:47,400 --> 00:12:49,300
I wonder what could be the matter?

129
00:13:00,179 --> 00:13:04,309
Don't come in, I have a wicked cold!

130
00:13:04,417 --> 00:13:06,146
I don't want you to catch it.

131
00:13:06,953 --> 00:13:10,947
My Lord, you sound 90 years old.

132
00:13:11,057 --> 00:13:13,822
I'm just going to stay in bed today.

133
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:16,657
Really? Okay... see you later.

134
00:13:32,045 --> 00:13:33,843
Listen Granny, you're going to be just fine.

135
00:13:33,946 --> 00:13:35,710
You seem healthy enough

136
00:13:35,815 --> 00:13:38,182
and these clothes even fit you better now.

137
00:13:40,620 --> 00:13:43,021
But I can't stay here, can I.

138
00:13:53,599 --> 00:13:57,934
Oww... getting old isn't easy, is it.

139
00:14:22,495 --> 00:14:24,862
Shall I help you down, ma'am?

140
00:14:24,964 --> 00:14:28,628
How kind of you young man, I'll be fine.

141
00:14:29,502 --> 00:14:30,697
I mean, sure.

142
00:14:30,803 --> 00:14:32,362
But where are you going anyway?

143
00:14:32,472 --> 00:14:35,066
Just past where you're going.

144
00:14:39,779 --> 00:14:41,804
I'm telling you, lady!

145
00:14:41,914 --> 00:14:44,508
It's just wizards and their lot up ahead!

146
00:14:44,617 --> 00:14:47,018
I'll keep that in mind!

147
00:14:47,186 --> 00:14:49,484
She's heading into the valley at this hour?

148
00:14:49,589 --> 00:14:52,081
Yeah, says her sister lives out there.

149
00:15:05,738 --> 00:15:09,436
I haven't even made it that far.

150
00:15:11,043 --> 00:15:14,308
At least my teeth are still as they were.

151
00:15:21,654 --> 00:15:23,713
You know what? I need a cane.

152
00:15:23,890 --> 00:15:25,654
Up we go!

153
00:15:25,758 --> 00:15:27,487
Oww...

154
00:15:32,064 --> 00:15:34,761
Might be a bit thick.

155
00:15:44,410 --> 00:15:46,936
What a stubborn stick.

156
00:15:49,415 --> 00:15:51,782
I might be old but I'm no pushover!

157
00:15:52,185 --> 00:15:53,846
Come on!

158
00:16:04,464 --> 00:16:08,901
A scarecrow?
For a moment I thought it was another witch's trick.

159
00:16:09,001 --> 00:16:11,971
But wait a minute... how are you standing on your own?

160
00:16:14,574 --> 00:16:16,599
You've got a turnip for a head.

161
00:16:16,976 --> 00:16:20,344
You know, I never liked turnips...

162
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:23,040
Well I'm sure you're glad to be out of that bush.

163
00:16:23,182 --> 00:16:25,276
Farewell!

164
00:16:32,091 --> 00:16:34,321
It's getting colder.

165
00:16:34,427 --> 00:16:36,657
The town still seems so close.

166
00:16:42,201 --> 00:16:44,533
Hey, don't follow me!

167
00:16:44,637 --> 00:16:46,765
You don't need to pay back the favour.

168
00:16:47,106 --> 00:16:49,131
You're some sort of magic thing too right?

169
00:16:49,242 --> 00:16:52,109
I've had quite enough of magic and witches, thank you!

170
00:16:52,678 --> 00:16:55,511
Go prop yourself up somewhere nice.

171
00:17:16,569 --> 00:17:20,005
What a perfect little cane. Thank you.

172
00:17:20,106 --> 00:17:21,403
While you're at it,

173
00:17:21,507 --> 00:17:24,408
I sure wouldn't mind if you found me a place for the night.

174
00:17:35,488 --> 00:17:38,253
Looks like I got more clever with age too.

175
00:17:49,135 --> 00:17:51,103
Look at that thing.

176
00:17:52,772 --> 00:17:55,036
I never thought that age meant

177
00:17:55,141 --> 00:17:57,838
my body would stop doing what I tell it.

178
00:18:14,293 --> 00:18:16,091
I smell smoke.

179
00:18:16,195 --> 00:18:19,165
Is there a hut nearby?

180
00:18:38,217 --> 00:18:40,948
Mr. Turnip, this is Howl's castle!

181
00:18:41,387 --> 00:18:44,186
I told you to find me a place for the night, but...

182
00:18:44,290 --> 00:18:45,121
I never thought...

183
00:18:55,968 --> 00:18:59,131
How is this even a castle?

184
00:19:19,325 --> 00:19:21,419
Is that the way in?

185
00:19:23,329 --> 00:19:25,491
Hey, slow down!

186
00:19:27,166 --> 00:19:29,533
Come on...

187
00:19:30,369 --> 00:19:33,134
Are you letting me on or not?

188
00:19:37,677 --> 00:19:39,475
My shawl...

189
00:19:52,558 --> 00:19:54,549
Turnip, I'm heading in. It looks warm in there.

190
00:19:54,660 --> 00:19:56,253
I don't think he'll mind a guest.

191
00:19:56,362 --> 00:19:58,558
Thanks again!

192
00:19:58,664 --> 00:20:00,063
Even if it is Howl, he'll never eat

193
00:20:00,166 --> 00:20:01,600
an old hag like me!

194
00:20:04,370 --> 00:20:06,099
It's farewell for real this time.

195
00:20:06,205 --> 00:20:09,106
A turnip you may be, but I like you.

196
00:20:09,208 --> 00:20:11,700
All the best!

197
00:20:58,257 --> 00:20:59,986
What is this place?

198
00:21:00,092 --> 00:21:02,686
It's practically falling apart.

199
00:21:11,337 --> 00:21:14,170
Well, I suppose at this age

200
00:21:14,273 --> 00:21:15,934
there's not much that can surprise me anymore.

201
00:21:25,518 --> 00:21:28,317
That's quite the curse eh.

202
00:21:28,821 --> 00:21:31,984
It's going to be a pain to get rid of that one.

203
00:21:33,459 --> 00:21:34,790
The fire is talking to me.

204
00:21:34,927 --> 00:21:37,396
Seems you can't even talk about it either.

205
00:21:37,763 --> 00:21:39,390
Are you Howl?

206
00:21:39,498 --> 00:21:41,933
Nope, I'm Calcifer

207
00:21:42,034 --> 00:21:44,059
the terrible Fire Demon!

208
00:21:44,436 --> 00:21:45,870
Okay Calcifer

209
00:21:45,971 --> 00:21:48,804
can you get rid of this curse on me?

210
00:21:49,441 --> 00:21:50,499
Sure!

211
00:21:50,609 --> 00:21:51,838
All you gotta do

212
00:21:51,944 --> 00:21:53,139
is get rid of the magic binding me here

213
00:21:53,245 --> 00:21:55,805
and I'll undo yours as well.

214
00:21:56,615 --> 00:21:59,346
A deal with the devil?

215
00:21:59,552 --> 00:22:01,919
Can I really trust you?

216
00:22:02,254 --> 00:22:04,586
Probably not, I am a demon after all.

217
00:22:06,058 --> 00:22:07,651
So much for that.

218
00:22:07,893 --> 00:22:10,055
No really, I'm a victim here!

219
00:22:10,162 --> 00:22:11,254
Howl bound me in a contract

220
00:22:11,363 --> 00:22:13,661
and he works me like a dog in this place!

221
00:22:13,833 --> 00:22:16,825
I'm the one moving this castle, did you know that?

222
00:22:16,969 --> 00:22:20,667
Oh that must be tough...

223
00:22:21,006 --> 00:22:22,974
If you can figure out the nature of our contract

224
00:22:23,075 --> 00:22:25,100
then the spells binding me will unwind.

225
00:22:25,211 --> 00:22:28,408
Then I'll fix you too, okay?

226
00:22:28,747 --> 00:22:33,207
Alright... it's a deal...

227
00:22:37,957 --> 00:22:39,220
Hey, lady.

228
00:22:39,425 --> 00:22:40,620
Lady!

229
00:22:45,431 --> 00:22:47,525
How am I going to explain this to him...

230
00:23:41,787 --> 00:23:43,380
Huh? Who's this?

231
00:23:43,489 --> 00:23:45,116
Port Town!

232
00:23:45,357 --> 00:23:47,485
How did she even get in here?

233
00:23:54,266 --> 00:23:56,325
I come!

234
00:24:00,239 --> 00:24:01,900
Ah, the honourable Mayor.

235
00:24:02,007 --> 00:24:03,873
It's well past morning, sir.

236
00:24:03,976 --> 00:24:06,001
Is Lord Jenkins at home?

237
00:24:06,345 --> 00:24:08,245
My master is out.

238
00:24:08,347 --> 00:24:11,009
I shall speak in his stead.

239
00:24:11,650 --> 00:24:14,415
This is a summons from his Majesty the King.

240
00:24:14,520 --> 00:24:15,851
It's war.

241
00:24:16,188 --> 00:24:18,714
By royal decree, all wizards, fortune tellers,

242
00:24:18,824 --> 00:24:21,759
and even witches are to answer the call.

243
00:24:21,860 --> 00:24:25,194
See that you and your master report in for briefing.

244
00:24:27,733 --> 00:24:29,462
Who even wants a war anyway?

245
00:24:30,336 --> 00:24:32,361
And who might you be?

246
00:24:32,938 --> 00:24:34,702
Calcifer let me in.

247
00:24:34,807 --> 00:24:35,933
I did not!

248
00:24:36,041 --> 00:24:38,100
She left herself in from the wastes last night!

249
00:24:38,477 --> 00:24:39,603
The wastes?

250
00:24:39,712 --> 00:24:40,941
That's odd.

251
00:24:41,413 --> 00:24:43,006
You're not a witch, are you?

252
00:24:43,749 --> 00:24:45,012
You think a witch could get in here?

253
00:24:46,452 --> 00:24:48,318
It's Port Town again!

254
00:24:49,221 --> 00:24:51,155
A customer maybe?

255
00:24:52,558 --> 00:24:54,185
I come!

256
00:24:56,962 --> 00:24:58,589
What is it, child?

257
00:24:58,697 --> 00:25:00,392
My mom sent me over.

258
00:25:00,799 --> 00:25:02,893
Ah, the usual charm?

259
00:25:03,002 --> 00:25:03,525
Yeah.

260
00:25:04,837 --> 00:25:06,999
Wait here while I fetch it.

261
00:25:12,177 --> 00:25:14,271
What?

262
00:25:23,956 --> 00:25:25,390
I'm not in the wastes.

263
00:25:25,491 --> 00:25:27,425
Excuse me, are you a witch?

264
00:25:28,927 --> 00:25:33,160
Oh yeah! The scariest one in the whole country.

265
00:25:33,265 --> 00:25:36,235
Cast this powder to the wind and the ships will have smooth sailing.

266
00:25:39,805 --> 00:25:41,432
Until next time.

267
00:25:43,442 --> 00:25:45,740
Stop playing tricks on my customers!

268
00:25:45,844 --> 00:25:47,744
And you should stop with that silly costume.

269
00:25:47,846 --> 00:25:49,780
This isn't a costume, it's magic!

270
00:25:52,518 --> 00:25:54,350
It's Kingsbury this time!

271
00:25:56,021 --> 00:25:57,045
I come!

272
00:26:02,528 --> 00:26:03,927
Is this the residence

273
00:26:04,029 --> 00:26:05,292
of Sir Pendragon?

274
00:26:05,397 --> 00:26:06,626
It is.

275
00:26:06,732 --> 00:26:09,827
I come bearing an official summons from the King.

276
00:26:09,935 --> 00:26:11,334
Please tell him that he is to appear

277
00:26:11,437 --> 00:26:14,407
at the palace at once.

278
00:26:15,140 --> 00:26:17,700
I will relay the message.

279
00:26:31,890 --> 00:26:34,552
A king would live in a place like this!

280
00:26:34,660 --> 00:26:37,391
Get back in here or I'm locking you out.

281
00:26:42,468 --> 00:26:45,460
Don't wander around!

282
00:27:20,806 --> 00:27:23,935
I said cut it out! I'm going to get angry!

283
00:27:24,910 --> 00:27:26,969
This is a magic house, isn't it?

284
00:27:27,079 --> 00:27:28,012
Lady...

285
00:27:28,113 --> 00:27:30,207
Where does the black one lead to?

286
00:27:30,315 --> 00:27:31,714
Only Howl knows that.

287
00:27:32,417 --> 00:27:34,715
I'm going to make breakfast.

288
00:27:43,996 --> 00:27:46,328
You even got some bacon and eggs sitting here!

289
00:27:47,266 --> 00:27:48,756
Yeah but without Howl

290
00:27:48,867 --> 00:27:50,426
we can't use the fire.

291
00:27:53,939 --> 00:27:55,873
Don't be silly, I'll do it.

292
00:27:56,341 --> 00:27:57,331
You can't!

293
00:27:57,442 --> 00:27:58,637
Calcifer only listens

294
00:27:58,744 --> 00:28:00,803
to what Howl tells him.

295
00:28:00,979 --> 00:28:03,641
Yeah! I'm not cooking no eggs!

296
00:28:03,749 --> 00:28:06,241
Oh how did my hat get on the floor...

297
00:28:09,855 --> 00:28:12,756
Alright Calcifer, time for work.

298
00:28:13,025 --> 00:28:15,323
No way! I'm a demon!

299
00:28:15,427 --> 00:28:18,089
You can't make me do anything!

300
00:28:18,530 --> 00:28:21,659
Oh? Maybe a little water will improve your motivation?

301
00:28:21,767 --> 00:28:23,201
Or maybe I'll just tell Howl

302
00:28:23,302 --> 00:28:24,701
about our little deal?

303
00:28:27,606 --> 00:28:29,973
We never should have let you in here!

304
00:28:30,075 --> 00:28:32,066
So are you helping me or not?

305
00:28:35,414 --> 00:28:38,543
See, that wasn't so hard.

306
00:28:40,786 --> 00:28:43,448
Just watch! I'll burn your stupid bacon!

307
00:28:43,822 --> 00:28:45,984
He's doing what she says...?

308
00:28:46,091 --> 00:28:47,320
I could use a cup of tea...

309
00:28:47,426 --> 00:28:48,825
Is there a kettle around here?

310
00:28:59,338 --> 00:29:01,432
Welcome back, sir.

311
00:29:01,573 --> 00:29:03,667
There are letters from the kings

312
00:29:03,775 --> 00:29:06,506
for both Jenkins and Pendragon.

313
00:29:17,089 --> 00:29:18,215
Calcifer

314
00:29:18,457 --> 00:29:20,084
look at you doing what you're told.

315
00:29:20,459 --> 00:29:22,086
She blackmailed me!

316
00:29:22,828 --> 00:29:25,798
That's not something just anybody could do.

317
00:29:25,897 --> 00:29:27,365
Who are you?

318
00:29:27,766 --> 00:29:30,463
Me? I'm old Sophie

319
00:29:30,569 --> 00:29:33,368
your new cleaner!

320
00:29:33,839 --> 00:29:35,034
Here, let me do it.

321
00:29:39,011 --> 00:29:42,174
Pass me two more bacon strips and six eggs.

322
00:30:02,567 --> 00:30:03,693
Nice.

323
00:30:04,436 --> 00:30:05,995
Oh that's good.

324
00:30:09,708 --> 00:30:12,473
So good!

325
00:30:13,011 --> 00:30:15,105
Who exactly hired you as cleaner?

326
00:30:15,747 --> 00:30:17,442
I hired myself.

327
00:30:17,549 --> 00:30:19,984
I've never seen such a dump.

328
00:30:21,920 --> 00:30:23,786
Markl, get the plates!

329
00:30:27,326 --> 00:30:29,761
You're all picking on me!

330
00:30:29,961 --> 00:30:31,622
You too, Ms. Sophie.

331
00:30:37,135 --> 00:30:38,762
You can sit here.

332
00:30:53,585 --> 00:30:54,575
Take one.

333
00:30:55,053 --> 00:30:57,078
These are the only ones that aren't dirty.

334
00:31:00,025 --> 00:31:02,084
I've got my work cut out for me.

335
00:31:05,464 --> 00:31:06,488
Thanks!

336
00:31:09,301 --> 00:31:10,700
Oh, thank you.

337
00:31:12,204 --> 00:31:14,730
Everyone, bon appétit.

338
00:31:14,840 --> 00:31:15,864
Bon appétit!

339
00:31:15,974 --> 00:31:17,032
It's really been a while

340
00:31:17,142 --> 00:31:18,473
since we had a proper breakfast like this.

341
00:31:25,250 --> 00:31:28,151
Looks like I'm teaching manners too...

342
00:31:29,221 --> 00:31:31,986
So what's that in your pocket?

343
00:31:43,668 --> 00:31:44,760
Where did this come from?

344
00:31:44,870 --> 00:31:46,304
Hand it to me.

345
00:31:52,244 --> 00:31:55,145
It burnt the table! What is it, Howl?

346
00:31:56,047 --> 00:31:59,142
Old magic, and powerful.

347
00:31:59,518 --> 00:32:00,986
Is it the Witch of the Wastes?

348
00:32:01,987 --> 00:32:05,753
"Loveless one, he who swallows stars"

349
00:32:05,857 --> 00:32:08,224
"your heart belongs to me."

350
00:32:08,326 --> 00:32:09,725
So much for the table.

351
00:32:23,642 --> 00:32:25,406
It's gone! Amazing.

352
00:32:25,510 --> 00:32:28,002
The burn might be gone but the curse remains.

353
00:32:28,547 --> 00:32:31,881
Please finish your meals.

354
00:32:33,685 --> 00:32:35,517
Move the castle about a hundred kilometers.

355
00:32:35,687 --> 00:32:36,882
Love this stuff...

356
00:32:41,026 --> 00:32:43,017
And send some hot water up to the bath.

357
00:32:43,128 --> 00:32:44,289
ええ それもがさよ

358
00:32:46,631 --> 00:32:49,191
Are you a servant of the Witch of the Wastes or something?

359
00:32:50,435 --> 00:32:51,766
Don't be rediculous!

360
00:32:51,870 --> 00:32:54,498
After what that hag did to...

361
00:32:57,876 --> 00:33:01,938
I'm actually... I...

362
00:33:03,482 --> 00:33:05,041
I've had it!

363
00:33:05,917 --> 00:33:06,941
That Witch better watch out.

364
00:33:07,052 --> 00:33:09,043
The next time I see her, she's in big trouble!

365
00:33:09,154 --> 00:33:11,213
Come on, we have work to do.

366
00:33:15,327 --> 00:33:16,453
Alright you bugs!

367
00:33:16,561 --> 00:33:18,893
Better run now before I sweep you out the door!

368
00:33:21,266 --> 00:33:23,428
I bet you were having a great time before I came along...

369
00:33:30,475 --> 00:33:32,375
I'd like a certain charm whipped up.

370
00:33:32,477 --> 00:33:33,603
Can it wait?

371
00:33:33,712 --> 00:33:35,840
Our witch is in a frenzy today.

372
00:33:45,857 --> 00:33:49,020
Sophie, I'm going out!

373
00:33:49,861 --> 00:33:52,159
I'll die without more wood!

374
00:33:52,764 --> 00:33:54,630
What are you doing with those?

375
00:33:54,933 --> 00:33:58,301
I'm gonna fall!

376
00:33:58,837 --> 00:34:01,670
I'm going to clear out the ashes. Won't take a minute.

377
00:34:01,773 --> 00:34:03,707
This is really bad.

378
00:34:03,808 --> 00:34:05,537
I can't hold on!

379
00:34:08,446 --> 00:34:10,608
I'm going out...

380
00:34:12,684 --> 00:34:15,676
I'm seriously falling.

381
00:34:16,154 --> 00:34:18,418
I can't...

382
00:34:18,523 --> 00:34:21,720
Help ... can't hold on ...

383
00:34:21,826 --> 00:34:23,954
Sophie, hurry!

384
00:34:46,151 --> 00:34:49,781
I'd appreciate it if you'd treat my friend a little better.

385
00:34:54,326 --> 00:34:56,693
Where are you going, Howl?

386
00:34:59,064 --> 00:35:01,761
Markl, please tell our new cleaner

387
00:35:01,866 --> 00:35:03,664
to be a bit more careful as she cleans.

388
00:35:08,473 --> 00:35:10,339
What did you do?

389
00:35:11,242 --> 00:35:12,835
She almost killed me!

390
00:35:13,311 --> 00:35:14,301
If I die

391
00:35:14,412 --> 00:35:16,141
then so does Howl!

392
00:35:16,247 --> 00:35:20,514
I'm a cleaner. Cleaning's my job, so stop complaining.

393
00:35:21,519 --> 00:35:24,113
No, not the second floor!

394
00:35:24,689 --> 00:35:26,157
If I were you kiddo

395
00:35:26,257 --> 00:35:27,622
I'd hurry and put away all the things you don't want touched, eh?

396
00:35:28,827 --> 00:35:31,091
Do mine later, okay?

397
00:35:33,798 --> 00:35:37,029
A little bit of anger and I feel good as new.

398
00:35:40,605 --> 00:35:43,438
What a place...

399
00:36:19,511 --> 00:36:21,036
Look at this!

400
00:36:23,515 --> 00:36:25,643
Are you moving the castle all on your own?

401
00:36:25,750 --> 00:36:28,276
What? Of course I am.

402
00:36:28,386 --> 00:36:29,911
You're amazing, Calcifer!

403
00:36:30,355 --> 00:36:33,757
Your magic is the best. I'm floored!

404
00:36:36,061 --> 00:36:37,620
You think?

405
00:36:37,729 --> 00:36:39,788
You really think so?

406
00:36:46,137 --> 00:36:48,196
No, not yet!

407
00:37:20,572 --> 00:37:21,903
What a view.

408
00:37:22,073 --> 00:37:24,201
It's called the Stellar Lake.

409
00:37:29,247 --> 00:37:31,147
There's something stuck down there.

410
00:37:31,249 --> 00:37:33,650
Markl, give me a hand.

411
00:37:41,025 --> 00:37:42,220
Up you go!

412
00:37:42,327 --> 00:37:43,852
A scarecrow!

413
00:37:43,962 --> 00:37:45,930
Ah... I named him "Turnip".

414
00:37:46,131 --> 00:37:48,998
You just love getting caught in things, don't you?

415
00:37:57,976 --> 00:38:00,308
Looks like he has a crush on me.

416
00:38:00,411 --> 00:38:02,345
He must have followed me here.

417
00:38:02,447 --> 00:38:04,711
You're really not a witch?

418
00:38:04,816 --> 00:38:05,806
Oh but I am.

419
00:38:05,917 --> 00:38:08,443
And this witch just can't stand a messy house!

420
00:38:37,715 --> 00:38:40,582
Turnip, you're pulling too hard!

421
00:38:49,694 --> 00:38:52,254
Looks like he really loves laundry.

422
00:38:52,363 --> 00:38:55,162
It'll dry in no time.

423
00:38:57,101 --> 00:38:59,468
Do you think he's a demon or something?

424
00:38:59,571 --> 00:39:01,266
Calcifer doesn't seem to mind him.

425
00:39:01,372 --> 00:39:05,002
He could even be a spirit from another world.

426
00:39:05,543 --> 00:39:09,673
But I still can't believe we're in such a perfect place.

427
00:39:51,489 --> 00:39:54,288
Sophie, I put all the laundry away.

428
00:39:54,459 --> 00:39:57,895
Thank you. I guess it's time to go then.

429
00:39:58,129 --> 00:40:00,029
What a strange place.

430
00:40:00,131 --> 00:40:03,396
I've never felt this way before.

431
00:41:22,246 --> 00:41:26,308
You stink of flesh and iron.

432
00:41:45,970 --> 00:41:49,702
Much more of that and you won't be able to turn back.

433
00:41:53,578 --> 00:41:54,670
You see this?

434
00:41:54,779 --> 00:41:56,178
Sophie put them there for me.

435
00:41:59,417 --> 00:42:01,146
The war is getting worse.

436
00:42:01,252 --> 00:42:04,950
It's a sea of flames from the beaches to the northern border.

437
00:42:05,490 --> 00:42:07,754
I can't stand bomb fires.

438
00:42:07,859 --> 00:42:10,556
They just burn whatever's in front of them, no respect.

439
00:42:11,696 --> 00:42:13,164
Some of my colleagues were after me too.

440
00:42:13,264 --> 00:42:14,732
The Witch of the Wastes?

441
00:42:14,832 --> 00:42:18,291
No, just small fry. But they had turned themselves into monsters.

442
00:42:18,870 --> 00:42:21,862
Ahh... they're going to regret that.

443
00:42:21,973 --> 00:42:24,135
Probably no way back to their human forms.

444
00:42:24,642 --> 00:42:27,805
Might not be so bad... they won't remember what sadness feels like.

445
00:42:27,912 --> 00:42:30,574
The kings want you too, don't they?

446
00:42:30,681 --> 00:42:32,012
They do, but...

447
00:42:32,116 --> 00:42:33,675
Boil some water for me, will you?

448
00:42:33,785 --> 00:42:35,617
What? Again?

449
00:43:09,987 --> 00:43:12,285
He's been going through way too much water.

450
00:43:17,895 --> 00:43:20,523
I'm telling you, he's not going to eat any.

451
00:43:20,631 --> 00:43:21,757
It's fine.

452
00:43:21,866 --> 00:43:22,424
Mornin'.

453
00:43:22,533 --> 00:43:23,557
Good morning.

454
00:43:26,437 --> 00:43:28,428
The morning market, I can't wait.

455
00:43:28,539 --> 00:43:30,439
You know I've never seen the ocean?

456
00:43:31,275 --> 00:43:33,141
Look at it sparkling!

457
00:43:33,244 --> 00:43:35,269
Same as always...

458
00:43:44,589 --> 00:43:46,489
I don't like potatoes.

459
00:43:46,591 --> 00:43:47,717
Pay the man.

460
00:43:47,825 --> 00:43:49,224
Thank you.

461
00:43:49,527 --> 00:43:50,460
Come again!

462
00:43:52,330 --> 00:43:54,822
All of it's fresh off the boats!

463
00:43:55,166 --> 00:43:56,156
That's a tender one.

464
00:43:56,267 --> 00:43:58,736
I don't like fish.

465
00:43:59,003 --> 00:44:00,266
There's a battleship returning!

466
00:44:02,306 --> 00:44:04,138
Looks like there was another battle.

467
00:44:04,275 --> 00:44:06,243
Seriously? Sorry ma'am, come back later.

468
00:44:06,344 --> 00:44:08,005
It's burning!

469
00:44:23,628 --> 00:44:27,087
Hang in there!

470
00:44:31,335 --> 00:44:33,303
Sophie, let's go get a closer look.

471
00:44:33,404 --> 00:44:36,738
No I can't stand things like this... let's go back.

472
00:44:37,275 --> 00:44:39,869
And that's one of the newer models...

473
00:44:44,582 --> 00:44:46,311
Markl, there's a Rubber Man over there.

474
00:44:47,118 --> 00:44:50,850
Stay still! It works for the Witch of the Wastes.

475
00:44:56,761 --> 00:44:57,922
It's gone.

476
00:44:58,029 --> 00:45:00,433
Can the others not see it or something?

477
00:45:06,170 --> 00:45:07,968
There! In the sky!

478
00:45:08,239 --> 00:45:09,934
There's a bomber there!

479
00:45:10,041 --> 00:45:12,032
Sophie, that's an enemy airship!

480
00:45:17,915 --> 00:45:19,815
Sophie, it's dropping pamphlets.

481
00:45:20,151 --> 00:45:23,143
Leave them! Do not pick those up!

482
00:45:27,992 --> 00:45:29,393
Sophie, are you okay?

483
00:45:35,933 --> 00:45:37,697
Get me a glass of water.

484
00:45:54,719 --> 00:45:57,086
Sophie, did you mess with my drawers?

485
00:45:57,188 --> 00:45:58,587
Look at this!

486
00:45:58,689 --> 00:46:00,589
Look at this colour!

487
00:46:00,691 --> 00:46:02,557
Oh... what nice hair.

488
00:46:02,660 --> 00:46:03,752
I said look!

489
00:46:04,228 --> 00:46:05,389
You messed with the drawers

490
00:46:05,496 --> 00:46:07,362
and all the spells got mixed up!

491
00:46:08,666 --> 00:46:11,135
I didn't mess with anything, I just put things in order.

492
00:46:11,535 --> 00:46:14,163
Cleaning, cleaning... always cleaning!

493
00:46:14,272 --> 00:46:16,832
I told you not to get carried away!

494
00:46:16,974 --> 00:46:18,373
It's over.

495
00:46:19,377 --> 00:46:22,813
I'll never recover from this.

496
00:46:23,714 --> 00:46:25,273
Oh come on, you look fine.

497
00:46:33,391 --> 00:46:36,053
In fact I quite like it.

498
00:46:36,694 --> 00:46:39,425
No, it's over. If I'm not beautiful

499
00:46:39,530 --> 00:46:41,055
how am I supposed to go on living?

500
00:46:52,843 --> 00:46:55,471
Howl, cut it out!

501
00:46:55,980 --> 00:46:57,846
He's drawing out shadow spirits!

502
00:46:57,948 --> 00:46:59,313
This happened once before

503
00:46:59,417 --> 00:47:01,408
when a girl dumped him!

504
00:47:04,322 --> 00:47:06,416
Howl, cheer up.

505
00:47:07,124 --> 00:47:10,287
You can just dye your hair back, can't you?

506
00:47:20,671 --> 00:47:23,265
Oh, see if I care!

507
00:47:23,374 --> 00:47:25,750
I've never been beautiful, not once!

508
00:47:28,079 --> 00:47:30,343
I can't stand it here!

509
00:48:09,587 --> 00:48:10,986
Thank you, Turnip.

510
00:48:11,088 --> 00:48:13,056
You're such a gentleman.

511
00:48:13,157 --> 00:48:14,647
Sophie, come back in, quick!

512
00:48:14,759 --> 00:48:16,090
Howl's in trouble!

513
00:48:16,627 --> 00:48:20,222
Howl man, seriously! I'm going to go out!

514
00:48:23,200 --> 00:48:25,134
Save me!

515
00:48:26,771 --> 00:48:27,966
He's so dramatic.

516
00:48:28,072 --> 00:48:29,301
Is he dead?

517
00:48:29,407 --> 00:48:30,533
He'll be fine.

518
00:48:30,641 --> 00:48:32,575
A little temper tantrum never killed anybody.

519
00:48:32,676 --> 00:48:34,337
Give me a hand with him.

520
00:48:38,616 --> 00:48:40,641
Fill the tub right to the top!

521
00:48:41,452 --> 00:48:44,012
Come on Howl, use your feet.

522
00:48:55,399 --> 00:48:57,367
Alright Markl, you take care of the rest.

523
00:49:00,070 --> 00:49:02,164
And now I have to clean all this up.

524
00:49:11,048 --> 00:49:14,848
沿岸部に上陸ですって 見て /

525
00:49:20,157 --> 00:49:22,922
(ノックの音)

526
00:49:25,329 --> 00:49:27,730
(ソフィー) 入りますよ

527
00:49:35,072 --> 00:49:38,565
温かいミルクよ 飲みなさい

528
00:49:41,111 --> 00:49:42,545
ここに置いておくから

529
00:49:42,646 --> 00:49:45,638
冷めないうちに飲みなさいね

530
00:49:48,586 --> 00:49:50,418
行かないで _ ソフィー

531
00:49:58,429 --> 00:50:00,420
ミルク飲む?

532
00:50:10,407 --> 00:50:13,274
荒地の魔女が僕の家を探しているんだ

533
00:50:14,545 --> 00:50:15,341
えっ?

534
00:50:15,446 --> 00:50:18,040
港で手下を見かけたわ

535
00:50:18,749 --> 00:50:21,275
おぐくびぴよょようもの
僕は本当は勝病者なんだ

536
00:50:21,385 --> 00:50:22,375
このガラクタは

537
00:50:22,486 --> 00:50:24,978
全部 魔女よけのまじないなんださよ

538
00:50:25,089 --> 00:50:26,784
怖くて怖くて たまらない

539
00:50:28,058 --> 00:50:29,856
ハウルはどうして

540
00:50:29,960 --> 00:50:31,792
落地の廃女に狙われてるの?

541
00:50:32,563 --> 00:50:34,657
面白そうな人だなあと思って

542
00:50:34,765 --> 00:50:38,668
僕から近付いたんだ それで逃げ出した

543
00:50:38,769 --> 00:50:40,294
恐ろしい人だった

544
00:50:43,073 --> 00:50:44,097
そしたら今度は

545
00:50:44,208 --> 00:50:46,506
戦争で王様に呼び出された

546
00:50:46,610 --> 00:50:49,136
ジェンキンスにも ペンドラゴンにも

547
00:50:49,246 --> 00:50:51,715
ハウルって一体いくつ名前があるの?

548
00:50:51,815 --> 00:50:53,647
自由に生きるのにいるだけ

549
00:50:53,751 --> 00:50:55,378
ぶふうん

550
00:50:55,486 --> 00:50:57,853
王様の話 斬れないの タ

551
00:50:57,955 --> 00:50:59,150
あれ

552
00:50:59,823 --> 00:51:02,053
旋法学校に入学する時

553
00:51:02,159 --> 00:51:03,888
誓いをたてさせられてる

554
00:51:06,163 --> 00:51:08,757
王様に会いに行きなさいよ

555
00:51:09,133 --> 00:51:10,658
ええ?

556
00:51:11,168 --> 00:51:12,693
はっきり言ってやればいいの

557
00:51:12,803 --> 00:51:14,771
"くだらない戦争はやめなさい"

558
00:51:14,872 --> 00:51:16,636
"私は手伝えません"って

559
00:51:17,541 --> 00:51:21,500
ソフィーはあの人達を知らないんだ

560
00:51:22,246 --> 00:51:23,873
だって王様でしょう

561
00:51:24,281 --> 00:51:27,649
みんなのこと考えるのが王様でしよう?

562
00:51:27,785 --> 00:51:29,014
そうか /

563
00:51:29,219 --> 00:51:30,186
ソフィーが代わりに

564
00:51:30,287 --> 00:51:31,413
行ってくれればいいんだ

565
00:51:31,822 --> 00:51:32,948
えっ?

566
00:51:33,424 --> 00:51:36,018
ペンドラゴンのお母さんということでさ

567
00:51:36,160 --> 00:51:38,254
息子は役立たずの ろくぐくでなしですって

568
00:51:38,362 --> 00:51:39,454
言ってくれればいいんだ

569
00:51:40,030 --> 00:51:40,690
マダム・サリマンも

570
00:51:40,798 --> 00:51:42,459
あきらめてぐれるかがかもしれない

571
00:51:42,967 --> 00:51:44,992
マダム・サリマン?

572
00:51:48,172 --> 00:51:50,072
その帽子かぶるの?

573
00:51:50,174 --> 00:51:52,506
せっがかがぐく魔法で服をきれいにしたのに

574
00:51:52,610 --> 00:51:53,600
行っつてくるね

575
00:51:53,711 --> 00:51:54,872
うん

576
00:51:55,145 --> 00:51:57,409
(カルシファー) 行ってらっしゃーい

577
00:51:59,516 --> 00:52:00,711
ああ・...・ えっ?

578
00:52:05,189 --> 00:52:07,681
お守り 無事に行って帰れるように

579
00:52:09,627 --> 00:52:12,562
大丈夫 僕が姿を変えてついていくぐから

580
00:52:12,863 --> 00:52:14,353
さあ / 行きたまえ

581
00:52:22,473 --> 00:52:25,670
絶対うまくいかないって気がしてきた

582
00:52:33,951 --> 00:52:35,441
見守るってまさか

583
00:52:35,552 --> 00:52:37,350
カラスに化けてるんじゃないわよね

584
00:52:44,294 --> 00:52:45,090
ハウルならもっと

585
00:52:45,195 --> 00:52:46,526
派手なものに化けるわね

586
00:52:53,003 --> 00:52:54,198
まさかね

587
00:53:05,849 --> 00:53:09,012
王宮って遠いわねえ

588
00:53:50,327 --> 00:53:51,260
ハウル?

589
00:53:51,361 --> 00:53:53,455
あんた ハウルじゃないでしょうね?

590
00:53:54,631 --> 00:53:55,257
ヒン /

591
00:53:57,434 --> 00:53:59,027
もう・...

592
00:53:59,303 --> 00:54:02,238
年寄り犬に化けるなんて

593
00:54:02,339 --> 00:54:03,534
年寄りが どんなに大変なのか

594
00:54:03,640 --> 00:54:04,630
わかってるの?

595
00:54:07,845 --> 00:54:09,040
お久しぶり

596
00:54:09,146 --> 00:54:11,012
あの時の帽子屋さんでしょう?

597
00:54:11,381 --> 00:54:13,008
荒地の魔女 /

598
00:54:13,117 --> 00:54:16,143
ハウルに手紙届けてくれてありがとう

599
00:54:18,622 --> 00:54:20,590
ハウル 元気がしら?

600
00:54:20,958 --> 00:54:22,722
ふる
岩え上がっていたねわ

601
00:54:22,826 --> 00:54:25,591
、 そうじ
おがかがげで私は掃除婦として働いてるけど

602
00:54:25,696 --> 00:54:28,961
そりゃあ 良かったわねえ

603
00:54:29,833 --> 00:54:30,959
ところで あんた

604
00:54:31,068 --> 00:54:33,196
何で王様の所へ行くのよ

605
00:54:33,303 --> 00:54:36,762
しゅうしょよくぐかつどう
就職活動 / ハウルの所はもうウンザリ

606
00:54:36,874 --> 00:54:37,966
あんたこそ何なの?

607
00:54:38,609 --> 00:54:41,237
私は王様に呼ばれているの

608
00:54:41,378 --> 00:54:43,210
サリマンのバカもいよいよ

609
00:54:43,313 --> 00:54:45,975
私のカが必要になったみたいよ

610
00:54:46,316 --> 00:54:47,283
そんなことより

611
00:54:47,384 --> 00:54:49,614
私にかけた呪いを解きなさいよ

612
00:54:49,987 --> 00:54:53,924
あらダメさよ 私は呪いは かけられるけど

613
00:54:54,024 --> 00:54:55,719
解けない魔女なの

614
00:54:55,826 --> 00:54:58,295
お先に和失礼

615
00:54:58,662 --> 00:55:00,187
ちょっと待ちなさい

616
00:55:00,397 --> 00:55:02,627
待ちなさいってば /

617
00:55:03,400 --> 00:55:04,561
もう あんたがいなければ

618
00:55:04,668 --> 00:55:06,033
っつえなさ
杖で殴ってやったのに

619
00:55:23,987 --> 00:55:25,355
お前達 どうしたんだい /

620
00:55:25,556 --> 00:55:29,015
奥様 これより先は禁じられております

621
00:55:29,126 --> 00:55:30,719
どうかお歩き下さい

622
00:55:31,195 --> 00:55:33,960
圭司うじん
サリマンめ 世法陣など仕掛けて

623
00:55:34,064 --> 00:55:37,159
私に階段を上らせる気かい

624
00:55:38,435 --> 00:55:39,994
ヘックション

625
00:55:47,578 --> 00:55:48,773
追いついちゃうわ

626
00:55:48,879 --> 00:55:50,108
知らん顔して行くのよ

627
00:55:59,590 --> 00:56:00,284
ヒン /

628
00:56:03,093 --> 00:56:04,754
もう・...

629
00:56:09,333 --> 00:56:14,464
どっこいしじしよょっ...

630
00:56:15,272 --> 00:56:18,298
重い... 何でこんなに重いのよ

631
00:56:20,544 --> 00:56:26,244
ああっ・ よいしょっ

632
00:56:28,218 --> 00:56:32,121
ちょっと...・ 待ちなさいよ

633
00:56:32,389 --> 00:56:38,123
呪いの解き方でも思い出したの?

634
00:56:38,228 --> 00:56:41,926
だかがから それは...

635
00:56:42,132 --> 00:56:43,122
知らないの

636
00:56:43,367 --> 00:56:45,859
じゃあ 勉強するのね

637
00:56:49,973 --> 00:56:52,101
おかしいわね...

638
00:56:52,209 --> 00:56:55,839
何で あんな元気なの?

639
00:56:57,981 --> 00:57:01,849
ハア ハア・

640
00:57:03,587 --> 00:57:05,521
ちょっと下りて

641
00:57:11,862 --> 00:57:15,662
今日は やめといたら? 無理だよ

642
00:57:16,266 --> 00:57:19,531
あたしゃね ここをを追い出されてかがから

643
00:57:19,636 --> 00:57:23,402
50年もね 基地でこの日が来るのを

644
00:57:23,507 --> 00:57:26,306
ずーっと待ってたんだ

645
00:57:26,476 --> 00:57:28,240
じゃあ 頑張りな

646
00:57:28,345 --> 00:57:31,975
手和を貸すほど親切じゃないんでね

647
00:57:32,149 --> 00:57:34,641
おいで ハウル

648
00:57:34,918 --> 00:57:36,909
はぐじよょうもの
薄情者

649
00:57:37,020 --> 00:57:39,682
今度は もっとヨボヨボにしてやるから

650
00:57:48,231 --> 00:57:51,531
どっこいしょっと

651
00:58:00,610 --> 00:58:02,704
早くおいで一

652
00:58:03,513 --> 00:58:05,743
奥様 ご案内します

653
00:58:06,016 --> 00:58:09,077
それより あの人を助けてあげなさいよ

654
00:58:09,186 --> 00:58:10,483
お手をお貸しすることは

655
00:58:10,587 --> 00:58:12,180
禁じられております

656
00:58:12,322 --> 00:58:13,289
何よ

657
00:58:13,390 --> 00:58:15,484
来いって言ったのは王様じゃない

658
00:58:15,592 --> 00:58:17,993
あんた 頑張りな

659
00:58:18,762 --> 00:58:20,992
もうちよっとよ

660
00:58:21,365 --> 00:58:24,266
それでも魔女なの?

661
00:58:25,002 --> 00:58:29,337
うるさいわね ハア ハア ハア...

662
00:58:29,406 --> 00:58:31,374
あんた 急に老けてない?

663
00:58:32,476 --> 00:58:36,140
ペンドラゴン夫人 基地の魔女さま

664
00:58:37,147 --> 00:58:38,740
しっかりしなさいよ

665
00:58:38,849 --> 00:58:42,012
ここに来たかなったんでしよょよう?

666
00:58:44,421 --> 00:58:47,789
ペンドラゴン夫人 荒地の魔女さま

667
00:58:47,891 --> 00:58:52,021
ペンドラゴン? 聞いたことある名だね

668
00:58:52,129 --> 00:58:53,392
当たり前でしよ

669
00:58:53,497 --> 00:58:55,727
私のいた帽子屋の名前だもの

670
00:58:55,832 --> 00:58:56,924
そうだっけ

671
00:58:57,467 --> 00:58:59,868
こちらでお待ち下さい

672
00:59:05,709 --> 00:59:06,870
イス /

673
00:59:07,177 --> 00:59:09,407
私のだよ

674
00:59:20,657 --> 00:59:23,456
ハウル こっちおいで

675
00:59:30,867 --> 00:59:32,494
奥様はこちらへ

676
00:59:46,283 --> 00:59:47,307
うっ・‥...・うっ...・ ああ/

677
00:59:51,121 --> 00:59:54,523
ああっ/

678
01:00:32,462 --> 01:00:34,988
ハウルのお母さまだそうですね

679
01:00:35,932 --> 01:00:37,991
はい _ ペンドラゴンと申します

680
01:00:38,602 --> 01:00:41,003
お疲れでしよう どうぞ それへ

681
01:00:41,505 --> 01:00:42,631
はい

682
01:00:52,516 --> 01:00:55,975
私は王室付き魔法使いのサリマンです

683
01:00:59,589 --> 01:01:00,579
ヒン

684
01:01:02,125 --> 01:01:03,524
あの その犬は...

685
01:01:04,227 --> 01:01:05,695
ヒンのこと?

686
01:01:05,795 --> 01:01:09,356
私の使い犬 あなたを案内させました

687
01:01:11,535 --> 01:01:12,866
はあ・...・

688
01:01:13,603 --> 01:01:15,867
つまりハウルは来ないのですね?

689
01:01:17,474 --> 01:01:20,444
母親を身代わりにするような息子です

690
01:01:20,544 --> 01:01:23,377
王様のお役には立たないと思います

691
01:01:24,614 --> 01:01:27,140
困ったことになりました

692
01:01:27,284 --> 01:01:30,948
あの子は私の最後の弟子なのに

693
01:01:31,421 --> 01:01:34,618
素晴らしいオ才能の持ち主でした

694
01:01:34,824 --> 01:01:37,225
あとつ
ようやく跡継ぎに巡り会えたと

695
01:01:37,327 --> 01:01:38,795
本当に嬉しかったのです

696
01:01:41,031 --> 01:01:44,331
ところが あの子は悪魔に心を礁われ

697
01:01:44,434 --> 01:01:46,596
私のもとを去りました

698
01:01:46,703 --> 01:01:48,501
廃法を自分のためだけに

699
01:01:48,605 --> 01:01:51,370
使うようになったのです

700
01:01:53,176 --> 01:01:53,972
お母さま

701
01:01:54,077 --> 01:01:54,635
はい

702
01:01:54,911 --> 01:01:56,879
あの子はとても危険です

703
01:01:56,980 --> 01:02:01,713
心をなくしたのにカカがあり過ぎるのです

704
01:02:02,319 --> 01:02:03,946
このままではハウルは

705
01:02:04,054 --> 01:02:06,352
芳地の魔女のようになってしまう

706
01:02:06,456 --> 01:02:07,389
ここへ

707
01:02:13,997 --> 01:02:15,624
あんた どうしちゃったの?

708
01:02:17,734 --> 01:02:20,795
本当の歳に戻してあげただけです

709
01:02:20,904 --> 01:02:22,565
もう魔力はありません

710
01:02:23,039 --> 01:02:24,564
その人も昔は

711
01:02:24,674 --> 01:02:27,075
とても素晴らしい魔法使いでした

712
01:02:27,577 --> 01:02:29,272
悪魔と取り引きをして

713
01:02:29,379 --> 01:02:31,279
長い間に 身も心も

714
01:02:31,381 --> 01:02:33,679
食い尽くされてしまったのです

715
01:02:34,084 --> 01:02:37,179
今 王国はいかがわしい魔法使いや

716
01:02:37,287 --> 01:02:39,813
諾女を野放しには出来ません

717
01:02:39,923 --> 01:02:41,357
ハウルがここへ来て

718
01:02:41,458 --> 01:02:43,324
王国のために尽くすなら

719
01:02:43,426 --> 01:02:46,327
悪魔と手を切る方法を教えます

720
01:02:46,730 --> 01:02:49,097
来ないならカ W幡時に ます

721
01:02:49,199 --> 01:02:50,598
その女のように

722
01:02:51,768 --> 01:02:52,792
お言葉ですが

723
01:02:54,404 --> 01:02:56,395
ハウルが なぜ ここへ来だがらないのか

724
01:02:56,506 --> 01:02:57,439
わがりました

725
01:02:57,974 --> 01:03:00,409
ここは変です 招いておきながら

726
01:03:00,510 --> 01:03:02,308
年寄りに階段を上らせたり

727
01:03:02,412 --> 01:03:05,313
変な部屋に連れ込んだり まるで師だわ

728
01:03:05,682 --> 01:03:07,650
ハウルに心がないですって?

729
01:03:07,751 --> 01:03:09,651
確かに わがままで磨病で

730
01:03:09,753 --> 01:03:12,085
何を考えているかわからないわ

731
01:03:12,188 --> 01:03:13,849
でも あの人はまっすぐよ

732
01:03:13,957 --> 01:03:15,356
自由に生きたいだけ

733
01:03:15,825 --> 01:03:18,556
ハウルは来ません 魔王にもなりません

734
01:03:18,662 --> 01:03:19,493
悪魔とのことは

735
01:03:19,596 --> 01:03:21,428
きっと自分で何とかします

736
01:03:21,531 --> 01:03:23,363
私はそう信じます /

737
01:03:23,933 --> 01:03:26,630
お母さま ハウルに恋してるのね

738
01:03:27,504 --> 01:03:30,530
ハウルが来るのかい?

739
01:03:30,774 --> 01:03:33,937
ほしいよ ハウルの心厳ほしいよ

740
01:03:34,044 --> 01:03:36,206
あんた いい加減にしなさい

741
01:03:36,413 --> 01:03:37,642
ハウルは来ないのよ

742
01:03:39,282 --> 01:03:41,307
ハウルは来ますよ

743
01:03:42,285 --> 01:03:45,414
ハウルの田点が見つかったわ

744
01:03:51,594 --> 01:03:52,652
王陸下

745
01:03:52,762 --> 01:03:55,993
どうかな 体の具合は

746
01:03:56,099 --> 01:03:57,396
恐れ入ります

747
01:03:57,500 --> 01:03:58,865
会議はつまらぬ

748
01:03:59,135 --> 01:04:00,899
邊抜きに一飛びして来たのだ

749
01:04:01,571 --> 01:04:02,766
それは それは

750
01:04:02,939 --> 01:04:04,498
この者達は?

751
01:04:04,774 --> 01:04:07,141
笑法使いハウルの母君です

752
01:04:07,243 --> 01:04:08,836
ほう

753
01:04:12,515 --> 01:04:13,949
せっかぐだがな

754
01:04:14,050 --> 01:04:17,042
私は魔法で戦に勝とうとは思わんのだ

755
01:04:17,754 --> 01:04:20,155
確かに この王宮にはサリマンのカで

756
01:04:20,256 --> 01:04:22,247
てき ばくだん
敵の爆共は当たらない

757
01:04:22,359 --> 01:04:24,919
そのかわり まわりの町に落ちるのだ

758
01:04:25,028 --> 01:04:26,621
廃法とはそういうものだ

759
01:04:26,730 --> 01:04:27,629
なあ サリマン

760
01:04:27,731 --> 01:04:29,893
のうベん
今日の際下は能弁ですこと

761
01:04:30,133 --> 01:04:31,601
サリマーンノ7

762
01:04:32,969 --> 01:04:34,198
ええっ?

763
01:04:34,571 --> 01:04:36,005
いよいよ決戦だぞ

764
01:04:36,106 --> 01:04:39,098
今度こそ たたきのめしてやる

765
01:04:39,342 --> 01:04:42,334
アハハハハ サリマン

766
01:04:42,445 --> 01:04:44,641
今度の影武者は よく出来てるな

767
01:04:44,748 --> 01:04:45,681
良い知らせを待て

768
01:04:45,782 --> 01:04:47,079
恐れ入ります

769
01:04:47,817 --> 01:04:49,216
将軍達は集まったかが

770
01:04:49,319 --> 01:04:50,220
はい

771
01:04:53,623 --> 01:04:56,456
ハウル 久しぶりね

772
01:04:56,559 --> 01:04:58,721
先生もお元気で何よりです

773
01:04:58,828 --> 01:05:00,956
始めからわかっていましたよ

774
01:05:01,064 --> 01:05:03,226
ちか
着いは守りました

775
01:05:03,333 --> 01:05:05,802
先生と戦いたくはありません

776
01:05:06,002 --> 01:05:07,470
母を連れて行きます

777
01:05:07,604 --> 01:05:09,436
逃がしませんよ

778
01:05:25,288 --> 01:05:28,781
ヒヤャーッ アア...

779
01:05:30,927 --> 01:05:33,021
下を見ないで すごいカだ

780
01:05:33,630 --> 01:05:34,529
お母さまに

781
01:05:34,631 --> 01:05:38,226
そなたの正体を見せてあげよう

782
01:06:25,915 --> 01:06:29,852
アアアア...

783
01:06:31,788 --> 01:06:33,552
ハウル ダメ 覧ょ 7

784
01:06:46,135 --> 01:06:47,261
つかまって

785
01:06:55,712 --> 01:06:57,874
